  "releaseNotes": "v3.2\nAdd Greek, Belarusian, Macedonian, Armenian and Kazakh language support.\nRefined mappings and cleanup.\n\nv3.1\nBugFix for Serbian Language.\nAdd Georgian Language.\n\nv3.0\nBugFix for Russian Language. \nBugFix for Bulgarian Language.\nAdd Factory pattern;\nAdd XUnit Tests;\n\nv2.2.1\nAdd MIT Licence\n\nv2.2.0\nAdd conversion for Ukrainian language. \n\nv2.1.2\nAdd GitHub repository\n\nv2.1.1\nAdd conversion for Bulgarian language. \n\nv2.1.0\nAdd conversion for Russian language.\n\nv2.0.3\nAdd conversion for Russian language.\n\nv2.0.2\nAdded Relases notes for all versions.\nRefactoring...\n\nv2.0.1\nAdded Tags, Description...\n\nv2.0.0\nAdded convert with extension method (ToSerbianLatin, ToSerbianCyrilic).\n\nv1.0.0\nInitial release: Cyrillic ⇆ Latin conversion for Serbian.\n\nIf you have any questions, comments, or run into any problems, don't hesitate to send me an e-mail at\nnenadbajcetic@hotmail.com",
